# Anchored on purpose: unanchored patterns would reach into third-party/protomotions.
# ProtoMotions writes results/, output/ (renderings) and wandb/ under the cwd; runs are launched
# from inside their experiment directory, so that is where they land (see CLAUDE.md).
/robocup_rl/experiments/*/results/
/robocup_rl/experiments/*/wandb/
/.venv*/
# Written by the editable install of robocup_rl.
/robocup_simulations.egg-info/
/venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
/robocup_rl/experiments/*/output/
